60-## v2 Requirements
61-
62-### Analytics
63-
64-- **ANALYTICS-01**: User can see aggregate stats (records per type, average duration, frequency over time)
65-- **ANALYTICS-02**: User can export records as CSV
66-
67-### Enhanced Charts
68-
69-- **ECHART-01**: Chart displays divergence record markers (vertical lines or highlights) at logged time ranges
70-- **ECHART-02**: User can click a marker on the chart to view the linked record
71-
72-## Out of Scope
73-
74-| Feature | Reason |
75-|---------|--------|
76-| Automated divergence detection | Defeats the stated Core Value of building personal judgment through manual review |
77-| Overlay/ratio chart | Loses OHLC candlestick detail; owner prefers stacked side-by-side |
78-| Click-to-populate calculator from chart | High implementation cost for a workflow the owner says is easier with manual entry |
